{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51580","headline":"舌 · 冯道","name":"舌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"口是祸之门，舌是斩身刀。\n闭口深藏舌，安身处处牢。\n（《古今图书集成·人事典》一四《口部》）（见宋胡穉《增广笺注简斋诗集》卷四《寄新息家叔》注引。\n《群书通要丙集》卷一引前二句。\n《喻世明言》卷三十八引此诗，不云作者。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}